{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9001_p", "source_sha256": "561110041ec3915eadb86c4393f68320796e1d2de14924f75cae33d01cdb39e7", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\n可奈のテーマは『一途系女子』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。\n可奈的主题是“一心一意系女子”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9002_036kan", "source_sha256": "e52faf2c3da36be2ee909e89fbb016ff900fbf4c4727680d954cd6838e664ada", "ja": "とってもかわいい衣装だな～♪　嬉しくて、\n可奈も歌っちゃう～♪　今日も撮影も楽しむぞ～♪", "zh": "这套服装真可爱呀～♪　可奈开心得都要唱起来了～♪　今天的拍摄也要好好享受～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9003_p", "source_sha256": "de42b600301c6f289436da694e17e558e24d8073a92da1132d2d3ef2e088084e", "ja": "はは、ご機嫌だな。でも今回の『かわいい』は、\n少しクセがあるけど……大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "哈哈，心情不错嘛。不过这次的“可爱”有点特别……你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9004_036kan", "source_sha256": "438214c5c270b77e61451b3e4f5b56cc84179a9bd0b716f7917753adfe0b1704", "ja": "はい！　とっても一途でクセになる……\nはれ？　つまりかわいいだけじゃダメってことですか？", "zh": "是！非常专一，让人越看越上头……\n咦？也就是说，光可爱还不够吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9005_p", "source_sha256": "0020e89b84d28ef98dbf02f53463c1fe962a76edf5d45c6793717fedf20bfca7", "ja": "ああ。周りの意見に左右されず、\n自分の思いを貫く一途さが表現できたら一番だけど。", "zh": "对。要是能表现出不受周围意见影响、贯彻自己想法的那份专一，那就最好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9006_036kan", "source_sha256": "986d8446b76caafdec2d9b9f050a1428c3443a8f4f4b4c4d6a6cc5524f32bd50", "ja": "かわいいけどクセがあって、周りに左右されなくて\n我が道を行く感じ……？　う～ん……。", "zh": "虽然可爱，却很有个性，不受周围影响，坚持走自己的路……？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9007", "source_sha256": "de060c818d3eec649702ad36361ce2fdbdf7b637b497429291bd4d080eefd938", "ja": "堂々と", "zh": "堂堂正正", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9008", "source_sha256": "db2a9a3cae5cda5c9f888b89a67909e4656e33c4ed2496b3c5a77a56e1ca4b9d", "ja": "あざとく", "zh": "卖萌地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9200_p", "source_sha256": "132ef6b59f45105f11ca7ad3baee3b3c928894f6d8833a66e63d2569aadc15cc", "ja": "自分が世界で一番かわいいと信じてるとか、どうだ？\n何を言われても、その信念を貫くんだ。", "zh": "坚信自己是全世界最可爱的人，这样如何？\n不管别人说什么，都要贯彻这股信念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9201_036kan", "source_sha256": "7f2d71b8fa5257ba7823f882a3c467f328b06986657e33b396523d0c6b3efbaf", "ja": "なるほど～！　堂々とですね！　それじゃあ、\nちょっと練習してもいいですか？　えっと……。", "zh": "原来如此～！要堂堂正正地说出来！那么，\n可以让我稍微练习一下吗？那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9202_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb3974c8454047cf12fcd395b8bc937e1556e512edab67386b3ca08387acb789", "ja": "「世界で一番かわいいのは誰だと思う？　もちろん……\n私、だよねっ♪」……えへへっ、どうでしたか？", "zh": "「你觉得全世界最可爱的人是谁？当然是……我，对吧♪」……嘿嘿，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9300_p", "source_sha256": "132ef6b59f45105f11ca7ad3baee3b3c928894f6d8833a66e63d2569aadc15cc", "ja": "自分が世界で一番かわいいと信じてるとか、どうだ？\n何を言われても、その信念を貫くんだ。", "zh": "坚信自己是全世界最可爱的人，这样如何？\n不管别人说什么，都要贯彻这股信念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9301_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a8d5acdc7d202d4c00a2a24986514b865edebbfc14f1368cb90e6e75b0316f2", "ja": "世界で一番！？　それって、すごい自信がないと\nできませんよね？　……ちょっと私、やってみます！", "zh": "世界第一！？那得有非常强的自信才做得到吧？……我稍微试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9302_036kan", "source_sha256": "77bb77c95327b9595d0ad5fcd32c5d7086ed2174a6d1b7e5c3bad221a3670db3", "ja": "よーし……可奈は世界で一番かわいい子～♪\n絶対絶対かわいい子～♪　……これで合ってますか？", "zh": "好～嘞……可奈是世界上最可爱的孩子～♪\n绝对绝对是最可爱的孩子～♪……这样对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9500_p", "source_sha256": "2ad3e12acf49bb1b023df93e2f7ec2165fa6f3a98d5b84ba2e3126985913a25b", "ja": "自分のかわいさを、あざとくアピールしてみよう。\n周りを気にしない雰囲気が出せると思うぞ。", "zh": "试着刻意表现出自己的可爱吧。\n我觉得这样能营造出一种不顾周围人的氛围哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9501_036kan", "source_sha256": "6eb86cf1ea2b0a9abeec849f5df1a3eba2207ffe23d38923a7a026d7facebc69", "ja": "わあ、さすが{$P$}さん♪\nそれじゃ、あざとくかわいく、がんばってみますっ！", "zh": "哇，不愧是{$P$}先生♪\n那我就试着表现得又机灵又可爱，好好加油啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9502_036kan", "source_sha256": "aeecd0514c9b00829821a05d0b56b1f98c3268289d0fc6caf749bbb56b3b482e", "ja": "「ねえ。私のこと、どう思ってる？　……かわいい？\nえへへ。すっごく嬉しいなぁ♪」……こうですか？", "zh": "「那个，你觉得我怎么样？……可爱吗？\n嘿嘿，我特别开心呀♪」……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9600_p", "source_sha256": "2ad3e12acf49bb1b023df93e2f7ec2165fa6f3a98d5b84ba2e3126985913a25b", "ja": "自分のかわいさを、あざとくアピールしてみよう。\n周りを気にしない雰囲気が出せると思うぞ。", "zh": "试着刻意表现出自己的可爱吧。\n我觉得这样能营造出一种不顾周围人的氛围哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9601_036kan", "source_sha256": "cadeb949113d8a38165a20ee0ce9181d1ea99d7ea0a48540a3e03f42e8bd0668", "ja": "わかりました。あざとくアピールすればいいんですね！\nあっ……それって、歌いながらでもいいですか？", "zh": "明白了。只要刻意卖萌就可以了吧！\n啊……那个，我可以一边唱歌一边卖萌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_9602_036kan", "source_sha256": "bc18b4780c88855a90a54913e909558b78b5b7ce14cdb84c33757f5e4d8b5e5a", "ja": "歌でアピールするのも、あざといかな～って思って。\nえへへ♪　私のあざとかわいい歌、聞いてください！", "zh": "我在想，用歌声来展现自己，会不会也很会卖萌呢～\n嘿嘿♪请听听我这首卖萌又可爱的歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
